<title>BANGLADESH: Glaxo Bangladesh 1996 net profit up 88 pct.</title>
<headline>Glaxo Bangladesh 1996 net profit up 88 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>	  (In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>			   1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Net Turnover	710	   vs     340</p>
<p>    Gross profit	225	   vs     113</p>
<p>    Net profit	  79	    vs     42</p>
<p>    Dividend	    2.5 taka on 10-taka share vs 10 percent</p>
<p>(Note: Glaxo Wellcome Bangladesh Limited, 81.98 percent of which is owned by Glaxo Group Ltd of Britain, held its annual general meeting on Sunday. The company, which marketed seven new pharmaceutical products in the year, paid a total dividend of 2.5 taka for the year including 1.0 taka interim dividend offered earlier on better half-yearly performance.</p>
</text>
